g/TS639280117122630000/reb10/highres/3/E4513483_40.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639280117122630000/reb10/highres/3/E4513483_41.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639280117122630000/reb10/highres/3/E4513483_42.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639280117122630000/reb10/highres/3/E4513483_43.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639280117122630000/reb10/highres/3/E4513483_44.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639280117122630000/reb10/highres/3/E4513483_45.jpg","https://ddfcdn.realtor.ca/listing/TS639280117122630000/reb10/highres/3/E4513483_46.jpg"],"remarks":"Backing onto a treed natural area in Heritage Lakes, this 5-bedroom, 3-bathroom home offers a peaceful setting on a quiet cul-de-sac. With nearly 1,500 sq. ft. above grade, the thoughtfully designed layout features vaulted ceilings, hardwood flooring, and a bright living room with a gas fireplace. The spacious kitchen offers an island with seating, ample cabinetry, and a corner pantry, while the adjoining dining area enjoys views of the backyard. Two bedrooms and a full bathroom complete the main level. Upstairs, the private primary suite features a double wall to wall closet and 4-piece ensuite with separate tub and shower. The fully finished basement adds two more bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a generous family room. Outside, enjoy the elevated deck overlooking the fenced yard and natural surroundings, with no rear neighbours. An attached double garage and convenient access to Heritage Lakes trails and amenities complete this inviting home. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$589,900"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bi-level"],["Bedrooms","5"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Living area","1,491 sq ft"],["Year built","1999"],["Neighbourhood","Heritage Lakes"],["Town","St. Albert"],["Postal code","T8N6W8"],["MLS® number","E4513483"],["Listed","October 19, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Central Vacuum, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverin